Every set generated by the generators is empty or a V-neighbourhood.

Induct on the generation. A generator is a neighbourhood and the whole space is the master. The intersection of two neighbourhoods is an intersection of level sets, hence empty or a level set, while an empty factor gives an empty intersection. A union is a neighbourhood by the union closure of V. The complement of the empty set is the master, and the complement of a neighbourhood is empty or a neighbourhood.
